<title>USA: Alaska Muni Bond Bank, won by Hutchinson Shockey.</title>
<headline>Alaska Muni Bond Bank, won by Hutchinson Shockey.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Shockey said it won $1.605 million of Alaska Municipal Bond Bank, general obligation revenue bonds, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.0005 percent.</p>
